{
  "_comment": "Link registry, customer overlay of the ops suite (layer CD, prefix CD_) on top of the product layers of the operations framework (ops-framework/config/links: S4CORE, FICA). Holds what is this landscape's own: custom tables and views (ZCD_*, ZI_CD_*), custom fields on standard tables (DFKKOP-ZZ_FIN_TRANS_NUM, DFKKOP-ZZ_BILLPLANID, DPAYH-ZZ_PAYMENT_STATUS) and the links between them and the standard objects. Facts: docs/USAA_Known_Tables.md. A field not confirmed in SE11 is evidence V with its VERIFY item; a field still unnamed is a placeholder in angle quotes - its links are PENDING (not seeded) until the item names it. The payment model mapping (config/payment_model/mapping.json) names the links of its joins; tools/payment_model.py renders them from this registry. Run tools/link_registry.py after a change (seed rows, lineage, CDS snippets, impact). docs/Link_Registry_Overlay.md.",
  "layer": {"id": "CD", "kind": "C", "rank": 30, "prefix": "CD_", "description": "Customer overlay of the ops suite",
            "owner": "PE RTB", "active": true},
  "objects": [
